    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.14-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৯.** $A = \\{x : x  ধনাত্মক পূর্ণসংখ্যা\\}$ এবং $B = \\{x : x  ঋণাত্মক পূর্ণসংখ্যা\\}$ হলে $A$ ও $B$ সেটদ্বয় নিশ্চেষ্ট, কেননা $A \\cap B = \\varnothing$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A = \\{x : x  ধনাত্মক পূর্ণসংখ্যা\\}",
        "B = \\{x : x  ঋণাত্মক পূর্ণসংখ্যা\\}",
        "A",
        "B",
        "A \\cap B = \\varnothing"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 11,
      "pdfPageEnd": 11,
      "printedPageStart": 6,
      "printedPageEnd": 6,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.14-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ১০.** $A = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  0 \\le x \\le 2\\}$ এবং $B = \\{x : x \\in N  এবং  0 \\le x \\le 2\\}$ হলে $B \\subseteq A, A \\cup B = A, A \\cap B = B = \\{1, 2\\}$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  0 \\le x \\le 2\\}",
        "B = \\{x : x \\in N  এবং  0 \\le x \\le 2\\}",
        "B \\subseteq A, A \\cup B = A, A \\cap B = B = \\{1, 2\\}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 11,
      "pdfPageEnd": 11,
      "printedPageStart": 6,
      "printedPageEnd": 6,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.14-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ১১.** $A = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  1 \\le x \\le 2\\}$ এবং $B = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  0 < x < 1\\}$ হলে, $A \\cup B = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  0 < x \\le 2\\}$ এবং $A \\cap B = \\varnothing$ অর্থাৎ $A$ ও $B$ নিশ্চেষ্ট।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  1 \\le x \\le 2\\}",
        "B = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  0 < x < 1\\}",
        "A \\cup B = \\{x : x \\in R  এবং  0 < x \\le 2\\}",
        "A \\cap B = \\varnothing",
        "A",
        "B"
      ],
